        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho atērēra Abisirayeli ikīza, gihēra mu gitondo gishitsa igihe cāshinzwe; uhereye i Dani ugashika i Beri‐sheba, hapfa abagabo ibihumbi mirongwirindwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
