            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi nyene Gadi aja kuri Dawidi, aramubarira, ati Dūga wubakire Uhoraho igicaniro ku mbuga ya Arawuna Umuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi yumvise irya Gadi aradūga, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yavuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Arawuna agize ngw ararāba, abona umwami n’ abantu baza iy’ ari; Arawuna arenga irembo, akubita inkoro hasi imbere y’umwami, aramwunamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
