          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi ahubakira Uhoraho igicaniro, ahosereza ibimazi, atanga n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe. Nuk’ Uhoraho abona guhangaza ico gihugu, ikīza kirabogozwa mu Bisirayeli.",
